      poc_must_show: ["value extracted in one transaction on a pinned fork block, in a stated unit", "the price before and after manipulation plus the cost of the swap (fees and slippage) in the same unit", "net profit (extraction minus manipulation cost minus loan fee) strictly positive", "the consumer call that converts the moved price into value, with the price-dependent argument named", "a control run without the price move showing the same call is unprofitable", "capital in versus capital out, with any flashloan demonstrably repaid"],
